"""Playbooks: how security engineers protect systems, part 2 (secure development, detection and response, people and governance, cloud, careers)."""

def build(P):
    D = []
    D.append(P("defense_appsec",
        ("secure software development|secure coding practices|how to write secure code|how developers prevent attacks|how to prevent sql injection and xss|application security best practices|devsecops|secure sdlc|how to protect a website|how to secure a web application|how to secure an api",
         "developpement logiciel securise|pratiques de codage securise|comment ecrire du code securise|comment les developpeurs previennent les attaques|comment prevenir l'injection sql et xss|bonnes pratiques de securite applicative|comment proteger un site web|comment securiser une application web|comment securiser une api",
         "gutegura porogaramu itekanye|imikorere myiza yo kwandika code itekanye|uko wandika code itekanye|uko abategura porogaramu birinda ibitero|uko wakwirinda SQL injection na XSS|uko warinda urubuga|uko wakomeza umutekano wa porogaramu ya web|uko wakomeza umutekano wa API",
         "uandishi salama wa programu|mazoea ya uandishi salama wa msimbo|jinsi ya kuandika msimbo salama|jinsi watengenezaji wanavyozuia mashambulizi|jinsi ya kuzuia SQL injection na XSS|jinsi ya kulinda tovuti|jinsi ya kulinda programu ya wavuti|jinsi ya kulinda API"),
        ("Secure software development (protecting websites and apps)", "Développement logiciel sécurisé (protéger sites et applications)", "Gutegura porogaramu itekanye (kurinda imbuga na porogaramu)", "Uandishi salama wa programu (kulinda tovuti na programu)"),
        ("Fixing a flaw after release costs far more than preventing it while building. Security is part of every stage of development (DevSecOps / “shift left”).",
         "Corriger une faille après la sortie coûte bien plus que la prévenir pendant la conception. La sécurité fait partie de chaque étape du développement (DevSecOps / « shift left »).",
         "Gukosora intege nke nyuma yo gusohora bihenze cyane kurusha kuzirinda mu gutegura. Umutekano uri mu ntambwe zose zo gutegura porogaramu (DevSecOps / «shift left»).",
         "Kurekebisha udhaifu baada ya kutoa hugharimu zaidi ya kuuzuia wakati wa kujenga. Usalama ni sehemu ya kila hatua ya uundaji (DevSecOps / «shift left»)."),
        [("**Threat modelling and security requirements** at design time: who could attack this, how, and what must never happen?", "**Modélisation des menaces et exigences de sécurité** dès la conception : qui pourrait attaquer, comment, et que ne doit-il jamais se passer ?", "**Threat modelling n'ibisabwa by'umutekano** mu gutegura: ni nde washobora kugaba igitero, ate, kandi ni iki kitagomba kuba?", "**Threat modelling na mahitaji ya usalama** wakati wa usanifu: nani anaweza kushambulia, vipi, na nini hakipaswi kutokea?"),
         ("**Validate all input on the server and encode output**: treat every input as hostile; this stops most injection and XSS.", "**Valider toutes les entrées côté serveur et encoder les sorties** : traiter toute entrée comme hostile ; cela bloque l'essentiel des injections et XSS.", "**Genzura ibyinjijwe byose kuri seriveri kandi usukure ibisohoka**: fata buri cyinjijwe nk'igitero; ibi bibuza injection na XSS nyinshi.", "**Hakiki ingizo lote kwenye seva na simba pato**: chukulia kila ingizo kama adui; hii huzuia injection na XSS nyingi."),
         ("**Parameterised queries and safe APIs**: never build SQL or shell commands by joining strings with user input.", "**Requêtes paramétrées et API sûres** : ne jamais construire du SQL ou des commandes shell en concaténant des entrées utilisateur.", "**Parameterised queries na API zitekanye**: ntuzigere wubaka SQL cyangwa amategeko ya shell uhuza inyuguti n'ibyinjijwe n'ukoresha.", "**Hoja zenye vigezo na API salama**: kamwe usijenge SQL au amri za shell kwa kuunganisha maandishi na ingizo la mtumiaji."),
         ("**Strong authentication and authorisation in the code**: hashed passwords (Argon2/bcrypt), MFA, short-lived tokens, and an access check on every request (stops IDOR/broken access control).", "**Authentification et autorisation solides dans le code** : mots de passe hachés (Argon2/bcrypt), MFA, jetons de courte durée, et contrôle d'accès à chaque requête (bloque IDOR).", "**Kwemeza no gutanga uburenganzira bikomeye muri code**: amagambo y'ibanga ahinduwe hash (Argon2/bcrypt), MFA, tokens z'igihe gito no kugenzura uburenganzira kuri buri cyifuzo (bibuza IDOR).", "**Uthibitishaji na idhini imara kwenye msimbo**: nywila zilizo-hash (Argon2/bcrypt), MFA, tokeni za muda mfupi na ukaguzi wa ufikiaji kwa kila ombi (huzuia IDOR)."),
         ("**Secrets management**: no passwords or API keys in source code or Git; use environment variables or a secrets vault; rotate leaked keys at once.", "**Gestion des secrets** : aucun mot de passe ni clé d'API dans le code ou Git ; variables d'environnement ou coffre ; renouveler aussitôt une clé fuitée.", "**Gucunga ibanga (secrets)**: nta magambo y'ibanga cyangwa API keys muri code cyangwa Git; koresha environment variables cyangwa vault; hindura urufunguzo rwamenetse ako kanya.", "**Usimamizi wa siri**: hakuna nywila au funguo za API kwenye msimbo au Git; tumia vigezo vya mazingira au vault; badilisha ufunguo uliovuja mara moja."),
         ("**Dependencies and supply chain**: keep libraries updated, scan them (SCA), keep an SBOM, pin versions, watch for malicious or look-alike packages.", "**Dépendances et chaîne d'approvisionnement** : mettre à jour les bibliothèques, les analyser (SCA), tenir une SBOM, figer les versions, se méfier des paquets malveillants ou imités.", "**Dependencies n'uruhererekane rw'abatanga**: vugurura libraries, uzisuzume (SCA), ugumane SBOM, ukosore verisiyo, ugenzure packages mbi cyangwa zisa n'izizewe.", "**Tegemezi na mnyororo wa ugavi**: sasisha maktaba, zichanganue (SCA), weka SBOM, funga matoleo, chunga vifurushi hasidi au vinavyofanana."),
         ("**Automated testing in the pipeline**: SAST (reads code), DAST (attacks a running test copy), dependency and container scans, fuzzing; block releases with serious findings.", "**Tests automatisés dans le pipeline** : SAST (lit le code), DAST (attaque une copie en marche), analyses de dépendances et conteneurs, fuzzing ; bloquer les versions avec failles graves.", "**Ibizamini byikora mu mugongo w'iterambere**: SAST (isoma code), DAST (igaba igitero kuri kopi ikora), gusuzuma dependencies na containers, fuzzing; kubuza gusohora hari intege nke zikomeye.", "**Majaribio ya kiotomatiki kwenye bomba**: SAST (husoma msimbo), DAST (hushambulia nakala inayoendeshwa), uchanganuzi wa tegemezi na kontena, fuzzing; zuia matoleo yenye udhaifu mkubwa."),
         ("**Security headers and safe defaults**: HTTPS and HSTS, Content-Security-Policy, secure/HttpOnly/SameSite cookies, rate limiting, CAPTCHA on login, generic error messages.", "**En-têtes de sécurité et valeurs par défaut sûres** : HTTPS et HSTS, Content-Security-Policy, cookies secure/HttpOnly/SameSite, limitation de débit, CAPTCHA à la connexion, messages d'erreur génériques.", "**Security headers n'igenamiterere ritekanye**: HTTPS na HSTS, Content-Security-Policy, cookies za secure/HttpOnly/SameSite, rate limiting, CAPTCHA mu kwinjira, ubutumwa bw'ikosa rusange.", "**Vichwa vya usalama na chaguo-msingi salama**: HTTPS na HSTS, Content-Security-Policy, cookies za secure/HttpOnly/SameSite, rate limiting, CAPTCHA kwenye kuingia, ujumbe wa makosa wa jumla."),
         ("**Code review, penetration testing and bug bounty**: a second pair of eyes, ethical hackers testing with permission, and a public way (vulnerability disclosure policy) to report flaws.", "**Revue de code, tests d'intrusion et bug bounty** : un second regard, des hackers éthiques qui testent avec autorisation, et un moyen public (politique de divulgation) de signaler les failles.", "**Gusuzuma code, penetration testing na bug bounty**: amaso ya kabiri, abahako b'imyitwarire myiza bagerageza bafite uruhushya, n'inzira rusange (vulnerability disclosure policy) yo gutanga raporo y'intege nke.", "**Ukaguzi wa msimbo, majaribio ya uvamizi na bug bounty**: macho ya pili, wadukuzi wenye maadili wakijaribu kwa idhini, na njia ya umma (sera ya ufichuzi wa udhaifu) kuripoti udhaifu."),
         ("**Logging and updates after launch**: log security events (without secrets), monitor, patch quickly and plan how to respond when a flaw is reported.", "**Journalisation et mises à jour après lancement** : journaliser les événements de sécurité (sans secrets), surveiller, corriger vite et prévoir la réponse quand une faille est signalée.", "**Logs n'ivugurura nyuma yo gusohora**: andika ibikorwa by'umutekano (nta secrets), ukurikirane, ukosore vuba kandi utegure uko usubiza iyo intege nke zimenyeshejwe.", "**Kumbukumbu na masasisho baada ya uzinduzi**: rekodi matukio ya usalama (bila siri), fuatilia, rekebisha haraka na panga jinsi ya kujibu udhaifu ukiripotiwa.")],
        ("Main secure-development practices", "Principales pratiques de développement sécurisé", "Imikorere nyamukuru yo gutegura porogaramu itekanye", "Mazoea makuu ya uandishi salama"),
        ["attack_web", "defense_overview"]))

    D.append(P("defense_detect_respond",
        ("detection and incident response|incident response steps|how to respond to a cyber attack|what to do after a cyber attack|soc and siem|security operations|threat hunting|how companies detect attacks|digital forensics|disaster recovery plan|incident response plan",
         "detection et reponse aux incidents|etapes de reponse aux incidents|comment repondre a une cyberattaque|que faire apres une cyberattaque|soc et siem|operations de securite|chasse aux menaces|comment les entreprises detectent les attaques|investigation numerique|plan de reprise apres sinistre|plan de reponse aux incidents",
         "gutahura no gusubiza ibitero|intambwe zo gusubiza ibitero|uko usubiza igitero cya interineti|icyo gukora nyuma y'igitero cya interineti|SOC na SIEM|imikorere y'umutekano|guhiga iterabwoba|uko ibigo bitahura ibitero|iperereza rya digitale|gahunda yo kugarura nyuma y'ibiza|gahunda yo gusubiza ibitero",
         "ugunduzi na kukabiliana na matukio|hatua za kukabiliana na matukio|jinsi ya kujibu shambulio la mtandao|cha kufanya baada ya shambulio la mtandao|SOC na SIEM|operesheni za usalama|kuwinda vitisho|jinsi kampuni zinavyogundua mashambulizi|uchunguzi wa kidijitali|mpango wa kurejesha baada ya maafa|mpango wa kukabiliana na matukio"),
        ("Detection and incident response (SOC, SIEM, response plan, recovery)", "Détection et réponse aux incidents (SOC, SIEM, plan, rétablissement)", "Gutahura no gusubiza ibitero (SOC, SIEM, gahunda, kugarura)", "Ugunduzi na kukabiliana na matukio (SOC, SIEM, mpango, urejeshaji)"),
        ("Prevention will sometimes fail, so engineers assume a breach and prepare to notice it fast and respond calmly. The time between break-in and detection decides how bad the damage becomes.",
         "La prévention échouera parfois : les ingénieurs supposent une intrusion et se préparent à la repérer vite et à réagir calmement. Le délai entre intrusion et détection détermine la gravité des dégâts.",
         "Kurinda rimwe na rimwe bizananirwa, bityo injeniyeri zibara ko igitero cyabaye zikitegura kukibona vuba no gusubiza utuje. Igihe hagati yo kwinjira no gutahurwa ni cyo kigena ubukana bw'ibyangiritse.",
         "Kuzuia wakati mwingine kutashindwa, hivyo wahandisi hudhani uvunjaji umetokea na kujiandaa kuugundua haraka na kujibu kwa utulivu. Muda kati ya uvamizi na ugunduzi huamua ukubwa wa uharibifu."),
        [("**Logging and monitoring**: record logins, admin actions, network and application events in a central place, kept safe from tampering.", "**Journalisation et surveillance** : enregistrer connexions, actions d'administration, événements réseau et applicatifs en un lieu central, protégé contre la falsification.", "**Kwandika logs no gukurikirana**: kwandika kwinjira, ibikorwa by'ubuyobozi, ibyabaye ku muyoboro no kuri porogaramu ahantu hamwe, hakingiwe guhindurwa.", "**Kumbukumbu na ufuatiliaji**: rekodi kuingia, vitendo vya usimamizi, matukio ya mtandao na programu mahali pamoja, pakilindwa dhidi ya kuchezewa."),
         ("**SIEM and SOC**: a SIEM correlates logs and raises alerts; a Security Operations Centre (SOC) of analysts triages them 24/7. Smaller teams use managed detection (MDR).", "**SIEM et SOC** : un SIEM corrèle les journaux et lève des alertes ; un centre d'opérations de sécurité (SOC) les trie en continu. Les petites équipes utilisent la détection managée (MDR).", "**SIEM na SOC**: SIEM ihuza logs ikamenyesha; ikigo cy'imikorere y'umutekano (SOC) kigizwe n'abasesenguzi bazisuzuma amasaha 24/7. Amatsinda mato akoresha managed detection (MDR).", "**SIEM na SOC**: SIEM huunganisha kumbukumbu na kutoa tahadhari; kituo cha operesheni za usalama (SOC) cha wachambuzi huzipitia saa 24/7. Timu ndogo hutumia managed detection (MDR)."),
         ("**EDR/XDR and threat intelligence**: tools that watch devices and networks for attacker behaviour (the MITRE ATT&CK techniques) and feed on shared indicators of compromise.", "**EDR/XDR et renseignement sur les menaces** : outils qui surveillent postes et réseaux pour repérer les comportements d'attaquants (techniques MITRE ATT&CK) et utilisent des indicateurs de compromission partagés.", "**EDR/XDR na threat intelligence**: ibikoresho bikurikirana ibikoresho n'imiyoboro mu myitwarire y'abagizi ba nabi (uburyo bwa MITRE ATT&CK) bigakoresha indicators of compromise zisangiwe.", "**EDR/XDR na threat intelligence**: zana zinazofuatilia vifaa na mitandao kwa tabia za washambuliaji (mbinu za MITRE ATT&CK) na kutumia viashiria vya uvamizi vinavyoshirikiwa."),
         ("**Threat hunting and deception**: analysts actively look for hidden attackers; honeypots and honeytokens (fake data and accounts) give an early alarm when touched.", "**Chasse aux menaces et leurres** : des analystes cherchent activement des attaquants cachés ; honeypots et honeytokens (faux comptes et données) donnent l'alerte quand on y touche.", "**Guhiga abagizi ba nabi no gutega**: abasesenguzi bashakisha abagizi ba nabi bihishe; honeypots na honeytokens (konti n'amakuru by'impimbano) bimenyesha hakiri kare iyo bikozweho.", "**Kuwinda vitisho na mitego**: wachambuzi hutafuta washambuliaji waliojificha; honeypots na honeytokens (akaunti na data bandia) hutoa tahadhari ya mapema vinapoguswa."),
         ("**Incident-response plan with roles**: preparation → detection and analysis → containment → eradication → recovery → lessons learned. Know who decides, who talks to the press and regulators, and who calls the police.", "**Plan de réponse aux incidents avec rôles** : préparation → détection et analyse → confinement → éradication → rétablissement → retour d'expérience. Savoir qui décide, qui parle à la presse et aux régulateurs, qui contacte la police.", "**Gahunda yo gusubiza ibitero n'inshingano**: kwitegura → gutahura no gusesengura → kugabanya → gukuraho → kugarura → amasomo. Menya ukora ibyemezo, uvugana n'itangazamakuru n'abagenzuzi, n'uhamagara polisi.", "**Mpango wa kukabiliana na matukio wenye majukumu**: maandalizi → ugunduzi na uchambuzi → kuzuia → kuondoa → kurejesha → mafunzo. Jua nani anaamua, nani anazungumza na vyombo vya habari na wasimamizi, na nani anaita polisi."),
         ("**Containment first**: isolate infected devices from the network (unplug the cable, disable Wi-Fi), disable stolen accounts, block malicious addresses, but do not wipe systems yet: evidence matters.", "**Contenir d'abord** : isoler les appareils infectés du réseau (débrancher le câble, couper le Wi-Fi), désactiver les comptes volés, bloquer les adresses malveillantes, mais ne pas effacer les systèmes tout de suite : les preuves comptent.", "**Banza ugabanye**: tandukanya ibikoresho byanduye n'umuyoboro (kura insinga, zimya Wi-Fi), hagarika konti zibwe, ubuze aderesi mbi, ariko ntusibe sisitemu ako kanya: ibimenyetso ni ngombwa.", "**Zuia kwanza**: tenga vifaa vilivyoambukizwa kutoka mtandaoni (chomoa kebo, zima Wi-Fi), zima akaunti zilizoibiwa, zuia anwani hasidi, lakini usifute mifumo bado: ushahidi ni muhimu."),
         ("**Digital forensics**: collect evidence carefully (disk images, logs, memory) with a chain of custody so you learn what happened and can support legal action.", "**Investigation numérique (forensics)** : collecter les preuves avec soin (images disque, journaux, mémoire) avec une chaîne de traçabilité pour comprendre ce qui s'est passé et appuyer une action en justice.", "**Iperereza rya digitale (forensics)**: gukusanya ibimenyetso neza (disk images, logs, memory) hamwe na chain of custody kugira ngo umenye ibyabaye kandi ushyigikire ikirego.", "**Uchunguzi wa kidijitali (forensics)**: kusanya ushahidi kwa makini (picha za diski, kumbukumbu, memory) pamoja na chain of custody ili ujue kilichotokea na kusaidia hatua za kisheria."),
         ("**Recovery**: rebuild from clean, tested backups; reset every password, token and key that might be exposed; patch the entry point; watch for the attacker returning.", "**Rétablissement** : reconstruire à partir de sauvegardes saines et testées ; réinitialiser tous les mots de passe, jetons et clés potentiellement exposés ; corriger le point d'entrée ; surveiller un retour de l'attaquant.", "**Kugarura**: kongera kubaka uhereye kuri kopi z'ububiko zizima kandi zagenzuwe; hindura amagambo y'ibanga, tokens n'imfunguzo zose zishobora kuba zarerekanywe; kosora aho binjiriye; ukurikirane niba umugizi wa nabi agaruka.", "**Urejeshaji**: jenga upya kutoka nakala rudufu safi na zilizojaribiwa; weka upya nywila, tokeni na funguo zote zinazoweza kuwa wazi; rekebisha mahali pa kuingilia; fuatilia mshambulizi akirudi."),
         ("**Disaster recovery and business continuity**: define RTO (how fast service must return) and RPO (how much data loss is acceptable), keep an offline copy of the plan and phone numbers, and rehearse.", "**Reprise après sinistre et continuité d'activité** : définir RTO (délai de reprise) et RPO (perte de données acceptable), garder une copie hors ligne du plan et des numéros, et s'entraîner.", "**Kugarura nyuma y'ibiza no gukomeza ubucuruzi**: gena RTO (igihe serivisi igomba kugaruka) na RPO (amakuru yemerewe gutakara), ubike kopi ya gahunda n'inimero hanze ya interineti, kandi witoze.", "**Urejeshaji baada ya maafa na mwendelezo wa biashara**: weka RTO (kasi huduma kurudi) na RPO (upotevu wa data unaokubalika), hifadhi nakala ya mpango na namba nje ya mtandao, na ufanye mazoezi."),
         ("**Report and learn**: notify affected people and the authorities where the law requires; hold a blameless review; fix process gaps; run tabletop exercises.", "**Signaler et apprendre** : prévenir les personnes concernées et les autorités quand la loi l'exige ; revue sans reproche ; corriger les failles de processus ; exercices sur table.", "**Gutanga raporo no kwiga**: menyesha abagizweho ingaruka n'ubuyobozi aho amategeko asaba; ikiganiro cy'isuzuma kitagamije kurega; kosora ibyuho mu buryo bw'akazi; kora imyitozo y'ibiganiro (tabletop).", "**Ripoti na kujifunza**: arifu walioathirika na mamlaka pale sheria inapohitaji; mapitio bila lawama; rekebisha mapengo ya mchakato; fanya mazoezi ya mezani.")],
        ("Main detection and response practices", "Principales pratiques de détection et de réponse", "Imikorere nyamukuru yo gutahura no gusubiza", "Mazoea makuu ya ugunduzi na kukabiliana"),
        ["defense_overview", "attack_after"]))

    D.append(P("defense_people_governance",
        ("security awareness training|cybersecurity policies|security governance|risk assessment and compliance|cybersecurity frameworks|nist framework iso 27001|human factor in cybersecurity|how to train employees about security|security culture|cyber security standards|cybersecurity laws",
         "sensibilisation a la securite|politiques de cybersecurite|gouvernance de la securite|evaluation des risques et conformite|cadres de cybersecurite|nist iso 27001|facteur humain en cybersecurite|comment former les employes a la securite|culture de securite|normes de cybersecurite|lois sur la cybersecurite",
         "amahugurwa yo gukangurira umutekano|amategeko ya cybersecurity|imiyoborere y'umutekano|isuzuma ry'ibyago no kubahiriza amategeko|inzego za cybersecurity|NIST na ISO 27001|abantu mu mutekano wa interineti|uko wahugura abakozi ku mutekano|umuco w'umutekano|ibipimo bya cybersecurity|amategeko ya cybersecurity mu Rwanda",
         "mafunzo ya uhamasishaji wa usalama|sera za usalama wa mtandao|usimamizi wa usalama|tathmini ya hatari na kufuata sheria|mifumo ya usalama wa mtandao|NIST na ISO 27001|kipengele cha binadamu katika usalama|jinsi ya kuwafunza wafanyakazi kuhusu usalama|utamaduni wa usalama|viwango vya usalama wa mtandao|sheria za usalama wa mtandao"),
        ("People, policy and governance (training, risk, standards, law)", "Personnes, politiques et gouvernance (formation, risques, normes, loi)", "Abantu, amategeko y'imbere n'imiyoborere (amahugurwa, ibyago, ibipimo, amategeko)", "Watu, sera na usimamizi (mafunzo, hatari, viwango, sheria)"),
        ("Technology alone fails if people are untrained or nobody owns the risk. Good security is a habit and a management system, not just software.",
         "La technologie seule échoue si les personnes ne sont pas formées ou si personne ne porte le risque. Une bonne sécurité est une habitude et un système de gestion, pas seulement un logiciel.",
         "Ikoranabuhanga ryonyine rirananirwa iyo abantu batahuguwe cyangwa ntawe ushinzwe ibyago. Umutekano mwiza ni akamenyero n'uburyo bwo gucunga, si porogaramu gusa.",
         "Teknolojia pekee hushindwa watu wasipofunzwa au hakuna anayemiliki hatari. Usalama mzuri ni mazoea na mfumo wa usimamizi, si programu tu."),
        [("**Security-awareness training**: short, regular, practical lessons (spot phishing, protect codes, report quickly) work better than one long yearly session.", "**Formation de sensibilisation** : leçons courtes, régulières et pratiques (repérer l'hameçonnage, protéger les codes, signaler vite) valent mieux qu'une longue session annuelle.", "**Amahugurwa yo gukangurira umutekano**: amasomo magufi, buri gihe kandi ashingiye ku bikorwa (kumenya phishing, kurinda kode, gutanga raporo vuba) arusha ayo mu mwaka rimwe maremare.", "**Mafunzo ya uhamasishaji wa usalama**: masomo mafupi, ya mara kwa mara na ya vitendo (kutambua hadaa, kulinda misimbo, kuripoti haraka) hufanya kazi kuliko kikao kimoja kirefu cha mwaka."),
         ("**Phishing simulations and a blame-free reporting culture**: staff who report a mistake quickly save the organisation; punishing them hides incidents.", "**Simulations d'hameçonnage et culture de signalement sans reproche** : un employé qui signale vite une erreur sauve l'organisation ; punir cache les incidents.", "**Phishing simulations n'umuco wo gutanga raporo utarimo kurega**: umukozi utanga raporo vuba ku ikosa arokora ikigo; guhana bihisha ibyabaye.", "**Majaribio ya hadaa na utamaduni wa kuripoti bila lawama**: mfanyakazi anayeripoti kosa haraka huokoa shirika; kuadhibu huficha matukio."),
         ("**Security policies**: clear written rules: acceptable use, passwords/MFA, device and BYOD, data classification, remote work, incident reporting, vendor access.", "**Politiques de sécurité** : règles écrites claires : usage acceptable, mots de passe/MFA, appareils et BYOD, classification des données, télétravail, signalement, accès des fournisseurs.", "**Amategeko y'umutekano y'imbere**: amategeko yanditse asobanutse: imikoreshereze yemewe, amagambo y'ibanga/MFA, ibikoresho na BYOD, gutandukanya amakuru, gukorera hanze, gutanga raporo, uburenganzira bw'abatanga serivisi.", "**Sera za usalama**: kanuni zilizoandikwa wazi: matumizi yanayokubalika, nywila/MFA, vifaa na BYOD, uainishaji wa data, kazi ya mbali, kuripoti matukio, ufikiaji wa wasambazaji."),
         ("**Risk assessment and a risk register**: list assets, threats and weaknesses, rate likelihood × impact, decide to reduce, transfer (insurance), accept or avoid each risk, and review often.", "**Évaluation des risques et registre des risques** : lister actifs, menaces et faiblesses, évaluer probabilité × impact, décider de réduire, transférer (assurance), accepter ou éviter chaque risque, et réviser souvent.", "**Isuzuma ry'ibyago n'urutonde rw'ibyago**: andika ibikoresho, ibyago n'intege nke, upime amahirwe × ingaruka, wemeze kugabanya, kwimura (ubwishingizi), kwakira cyangwa kwirinda buri cyago, kandi usuzume kenshi.", "**Tathmini ya hatari na rejista ya hatari**: orodhesha mali, vitisho na udhaifu, kadiria uwezekano × athari, amua kupunguza, kuhamisha (bima), kukubali au kuepuka kila hatari, na kupitia mara kwa mara."),
         ("**Frameworks and standards**: NIST Cybersecurity Framework, ISO/IEC 27001 (information-security management), CIS Controls, PCI DSS for card data, SOC 2 for service providers.", "**Cadres et normes** : NIST Cybersecurity Framework, ISO/IEC 27001 (management de la sécurité de l'information), CIS Controls, PCI DSS pour les cartes, SOC 2 pour les prestataires.", "**Inzego n'ibipimo**: NIST Cybersecurity Framework, ISO/IEC 27001 (gucunga umutekano w'amakuru), CIS Controls, PCI DSS ku makarita, SOC 2 ku batanga serivisi.", "**Mifumo na viwango**: NIST Cybersecurity Framework, ISO/IEC 27001 (usimamizi wa usalama wa taarifa), CIS Controls, PCI DSS kwa kadi, SOC 2 kwa watoa huduma."),
         ("**Audits and compliance**: internal and external audits check that the rules are followed; compliance is the minimum, not the whole of security.", "**Audits et conformité** : des audits internes et externes vérifient que les règles sont suivies ; la conformité est un minimum, pas toute la sécurité.", "**Igenzura (audits) no kubahiriza amategeko**: igenzura ry'imbere n'iry'inyuma risuzuma ko amategeko akurikizwa; kubahiriza ni byo bike, si umutekano wose.", "**Ukaguzi na kufuata sheria**: ukaguzi wa ndani na nje hukagua kama kanuni zinafuatwa; kufuata sheria ni kiwango cha chini, si usalama wote."),
         ("**Third-party and supplier risk**: check the security of vendors that touch your data; contracts should require breach notice, encryption and the right to audit.", "**Risque lié aux tiers et fournisseurs** : vérifier la sécurité des prestataires qui touchent vos données ; les contrats doivent exiger notification des violations, chiffrement et droit d'audit.", "**Ibyago bituruka ku bandi n'abatanga serivisi**: genzura umutekano w'abatanga serivisi bakora ku makuru yawe; amasezerano agomba gusaba kumenyesha amakuru yamenetse, encryption n'uburenganzira bwo kugenzura.", "**Hatari za watu wa tatu na wasambazaji**: kagua usalama wa wasambazaji wanaogusa data yako; mikataba iwe na taarifa ya uvujaji, usimbaji na haki ya kukagua."),
         ("**Law in Rwanda and Africa**: Rwanda’s personal-data protection law (2021) and the law on cybercrime, the National Cyber Security Authority (NCSA), Rwanda’s CSIRT, and the Malabo Convention. Check current texts on official sites before relying on details.", "**Droit au Rwanda et en Afrique** : loi rwandaise sur la protection des données personnelles (2021) et loi sur la cybercriminalité, Autorité nationale de cybersécurité (NCSA), CSIRT rwandais, Convention de Malabo. Vérifiez les textes en vigueur sur des sites officiels.", "**Amategeko mu Rwanda no muri Afurika**: itegeko ryo kurengera amakuru bwite (2021) n'iryerekeye ibyaha bya interineti, NCSA (Ikigo cy'Igihugu gishinzwe umutekano wa interineti), CSIRT y'u Rwanda, n'Amasezerano ya Malabo. Genzura inyandiko zigezweho ku mbuga zemewe.", "**Sheria Rwanda na Afrika**: sheria ya ulinzi wa data binafsi ya Rwanda (2021) na sheria ya uhalifu wa mtandao, NCSA (Mamlaka ya Taifa ya Usalama wa Mtandao), CSIRT ya Rwanda, na Mkataba wa Malabo. Hakiki maandishi ya sasa kwenye tovuti rasmi."),
         ("**Cyber insurance and continuity**: insurance can cover recovery costs but usually requires MFA, backups and patching to be in place first.", "**Cyber-assurance et continuité** : l'assurance peut couvrir les coûts de rétablissement mais exige souvent MFA, sauvegardes et correctifs au préalable.", "**Ubwishingizi bwa cyber no gukomeza akazi**: ubwishingizi bushobora kwishyura ikiguzi cyo kugarura ariko akenshi busaba MFA, kopi z'ububiko n'ivugurura mbere.", "**Bima ya mtandao na mwendelezo**: bima inaweza kulipia gharama za urejeshaji lakini mara nyingi inahitaji MFA, nakala rudufu na viraka kwanza.")],
        ("Main people, policy and governance practices", "Principales pratiques de gouvernance et de sensibilisation", "Imikorere nyamukuru y'abantu n'imiyoborere", "Mazoea makuu ya watu na usimamizi"),
        ["defense_overview", "scam_prevent_groups"]))

    D.append(P("defense_cloud",
        ("cloud security|how to secure the cloud|cloud security best practices|shared responsibility model|how to protect cloud storage|container security|securing cloud accounts|iam in the cloud|cloud misconfiguration",
         "securite du cloud|comment securiser le cloud|bonnes pratiques de securite cloud|modele de responsabilite partagee|comment proteger le stockage cloud|securite des conteneurs|securiser les comptes cloud|mauvaise configuration cloud",
         "umutekano wa cloud|uko wakomeza umutekano wa cloud|imikorere myiza y'umutekano wa cloud|shared responsibility model|uko warinda ububiko bwa cloud|umutekano wa containers|kurinda konti za cloud",
         "usalama wa cloud|jinsi ya kulinda cloud|mazoea bora ya usalama wa cloud|shared responsibility model|jinsi ya kulinda hifadhi ya cloud|usalama wa kontena|kulinda akaunti za cloud"),
        ("Cloud security (protecting data and services online)", "Sécurité du cloud (protéger données et services en ligne)", "Umutekano wa cloud (kurinda amakuru na serivisi kuri interineti)", "Usalama wa cloud (kulinda data na huduma mtandaoni)"),
        ("The cloud provider secures the data centre; you are responsible for your accounts, settings and data (the shared-responsibility model). Most cloud breaches come from misconfiguration and stolen credentials, not from the provider being hacked.",
         "Le fournisseur sécurise le centre de données ; vous êtes responsable de vos comptes, réglages et données (modèle de responsabilité partagée). La plupart des fuites cloud viennent de mauvaises configurations et d'identifiants volés, pas du piratage du fournisseur.",
         "Utanga cloud arinda inzu y'amakuru; wowe ushinzwe konti zawe, igenamiterere n'amakuru yawe (shared responsibility). Ibyinshi byamenetse muri cloud biva ku igenamiterere ribi n'amagambo y'ibanga yibwe, si ukubera ko utanga serivisi yahahuwe.",
         "Mtoa cloud analinda kituo cha data; wewe unawajibika kwa akaunti, mipangilio na data yako (shared responsibility). Uvujaji mwingi wa cloud hutokana na usanidi mbaya na vitambulisho vilivyoibiwa, si mtoa huduma kudukuliwa."),
        [("**Strong identity first**: MFA on every cloud admin, no shared accounts, least-privilege roles, short-lived access keys, review permissions regularly.", "**Identité forte d'abord** : MFA pour chaque admin cloud, pas de comptes partagés, rôles à moindre privilège, clés d'accès de courte durée, revue régulière des permissions.", "**Banza umwirondoro ukomeye**: MFA kuri buri muyobozi wa cloud, nta konti zisangiwe, inshingano z'uburenganzira buke, imfunguzo z'igihe gito, gusuzuma uburenganzira buri gihe.", "**Utambulisho imara kwanza**: MFA kwa kila msimamizi wa cloud, hakuna akaunti za pamoja, majukumu ya haki ndogo, funguo za ufikiaji za muda mfupi, kupitia ruhusa mara kwa mara."),
         ("**No public storage by accident**: check that buckets, databases and file shares are private; turn on “block public access”; use CSPM tools to flag risky settings.", "**Pas de stockage public par accident** : vérifier que buckets, bases et partages sont privés ; activer « bloquer l'accès public » ; utiliser des outils CSPM pour signaler les réglages risqués.", "**Nta bubiko rusange byabayeho nta kubishaka**: genzura ko buckets, database na shares ari ibanga; fungura «block public access»; koresha CSPM kugaragaza igenamiterere ribi.", "**Hakuna hifadhi ya umma kwa bahati mbaya**: kagua kama buckets, hifadhidata na shares ni za faragha; washa «block public access»; tumia zana za CSPM kuonyesha usanidi hatari."),
         ("**Encrypt and back up**: encryption at rest and in transit, customer-managed keys for sensitive data, backups in a separate account or region, tested restores.", "**Chiffrer et sauvegarder** : chiffrement au repos et en transit, clés gérées par le client pour les données sensibles, sauvegardes dans un autre compte ou région, restaurations testées.", "**Gufunga no kubika kopi**: encryption at rest na in transit, imfunguzo zicungwa n'umukiriya ku makuru y'ingenzi, kopi muri konti cyangwa akarere kadasanzwe, kugarura kugenzurwa.", "**Simba na hifadhi nakala**: usimbaji ukiwa umehifadhiwa na unaposafiri, funguo zinazosimamiwa na mteja kwa data nyeti, nakala kwenye akaunti au eneo tofauti, urejeshaji uliojaribiwa."),
         ("**Network and workload hardening**: private networks, security groups that deny by default, patched images, minimal containers, scan images and infrastructure-as-code before deploying.", "**Durcissement réseau et charges de travail** : réseaux privés, groupes de sécurité qui refusent par défaut, images à jour, conteneurs minimaux, analyse des images et de l'infrastructure-as-code avant déploiement.", "**Gukomeza umuyoboro na workloads**: imiyoboro y'ibanga, security groups zibuza mu itangiriro, images zivuguruye, containers nto, gusuzuma images na infrastructure-as-code mbere yo gutangiza.", "**Kuimarisha mtandao na mizigo ya kazi**: mitandao ya kibinafsi, security groups zinazokataa kwa chaguo-msingi, picha zilizosasishwa, kontena ndogo, kuchanganua picha na infrastructure-as-code kabla ya kupeleka."),
         ("**Logging and alerts**: turn on cloud audit logs (who did what), send them to a monitoring tool, alert on new admin users, disabled logging and unusual regions.", "**Journaux et alertes** : activer les journaux d'audit du cloud (qui a fait quoi), les envoyer vers un outil de surveillance, alerter sur nouveaux admins, journalisation désactivée et régions inhabituelles.", "**Logs n'imenyesha**: fungura audit logs za cloud (uwakoze iki), uzohereze ku gikoresho cyo gukurikirana, umenyeshe ku bayobozi bashya, logs zazimijwe n'uturere tudasanzwe.", "**Kumbukumbu na tahadhari**: washa kumbukumbu za ukaguzi wa cloud (nani alifanya nini), zitume kwa zana ya ufuatiliaji, toa tahadhari kwa wasimamizi wapya, kumbukumbu zilizozimwa na maeneo yasiyo ya kawaida."),
         ("**Secrets and API keys**: never in code or public repositories; use a secrets manager; scan commits for leaked keys; rotate immediately if exposed.", "**Secrets et clés d'API** : jamais dans le code ou des dépôts publics ; utiliser un gestionnaire de secrets ; analyser les commits ; renouveler aussitôt en cas d'exposition.", "**Secrets na API keys**: ntizigere ziba muri code cyangwa repositories rusange; koresha secrets manager; suzuma commits ushaka imfunguzo zamenetse; uzihindure ako kanya iyo zagaragaye.", "**Siri na funguo za API**: kamwe si kwenye msimbo au hazina za umma; tumia secrets manager; changanua commits kutafuta funguo zilizovuja; zibadilishe mara moja zikifichuka."),
         ("**For small businesses and farmers using cloud apps**: use official apps, MFA, separate admin and daily accounts, share files with named people (not “anyone with the link”), and keep a copy of important records offline.", "**Pour petites entreprises et agriculteurs utilisant des applis cloud** : applis officielles, MFA, comptes admin et quotidien séparés, partager avec des personnes nommées (pas « toute personne avec le lien »), garder une copie hors ligne des documents importants.", "**Ku bucuruzi buto n'abahinzi bakoresha porogaramu za cloud**: koresha porogaramu zemewe, MFA, konti z'ubuyobozi n'iza buri munsi zitandukanye, sangiza abantu bavuzwe (si «umuntu wese ufite link»), ubike kopi y'inyandiko z'ingenzi hanze ya interineti.", "**Kwa biashara ndogo na wakulima wanaotumia programu za cloud**: tumia programu rasmi, MFA, akaunti za msimamizi na za kila siku tofauti, shiriki na watu waliotajwa (si «yeyote mwenye kiungo»), weka nakala ya rekodi muhimu nje ya mtandao.")],
        ("Main cloud-security practices", "Principales pratiques de sécurité cloud", "Imikorere nyamukuru y'umutekano wa cloud", "Mazoea makuu ya usalama wa cloud"),
        ["defense_overview", "defense_identity"]))

    D.append(P("security_careers",
        ("security careers|cybersecurity careers|jobs in cybersecurity|roles in cybersecurity|how to become a cybersecurity engineer|how to start a career in cybersecurity|what does a security engineer do|what does a soc analyst do|penetration tester job|ciso role|cybersecurity skills to learn|cybersecurity certifications",
         "metiers de la cybersecurite|carrieres en cybersecurite|emplois en cybersecurite|roles en cybersecurite|comment devenir ingenieur en cybersecurite|comment debuter en cybersecurite|que fait un ingenieur securite|que fait un analyste soc|metier de testeur d'intrusion|role du rssi|competences en cybersecurite|certifications en cybersecurite",
         "imirimo y'umutekano wa interineti|akazi muri cybersecurity|inshingano muri cybersecurity|uko wakwiga ukaba injeniyeri wa cybersecurity|uko watangira muri cybersecurity|injeniyeri w'umutekano akora iki|umusesenguzi wa SOC akora iki|akazi ka penetration tester|ubumenyi bukenewe muri cybersecurity|impamyabushobozi za cybersecurity",
         "kazi za usalama wa mtandao|taaluma za usalama wa mtandao|ajira katika usalama wa mtandao|majukumu katika usalama wa mtandao|jinsi ya kuwa mhandisi wa usalama wa mtandao|jinsi ya kuanza taaluma ya usalama wa mtandao|mhandisi wa usalama hufanya nini|mchambuzi wa SOC hufanya nini|kazi ya mjaribu wa uvamizi|ujuzi wa usalama wa mtandao|vyeti vya usalama wa mtandao"),
        ("Cybersecurity careers: roles, skills and how to start", "Métiers de la cybersécurité : rôles, compétences et par où commencer", "Imirimo ya cybersecurity: inshingano, ubumenyi n'uko watangira", "Kazi za usalama wa mtandao: majukumu, ujuzi na jinsi ya kuanza"),
        ("Security is a team sport with many roles, not only “hackers”. There is strong demand for people who understand both technology and people. Start with fundamentals and practise legally.",
         "La sécurité est un sport d'équipe avec de nombreux rôles, pas seulement des « hackers ». La demande est forte pour ceux qui comprennent technologie et humains. Commencez par les bases et pratiquez légalement.",
         "Umutekano ni umukino w'itsinda ufite inshingano nyinshi, si «abahako» gusa. Hakenewe cyane abumva ikoranabuhanga n'abantu. Tangira ku by'ibanze kandi witoze mu buryo bwemewe n'amategeko.",
         "Usalama ni mchezo wa timu wenye majukumu mengi, si «wadukuzi» tu. Mahitaji ni makubwa kwa wanaoelewa teknolojia na watu. Anza na misingi na ufanye mazoezi kisheria."),
        [("**Security engineer / architect**: designs and builds the protections (network, cloud, identity); designs systems that are secure from the start.", "**Ingénieur / architecte sécurité** : conçoit et construit les protections (réseau, cloud, identité) ; conçoit des systèmes sûrs dès le départ.", "**Security engineer / architect**: ategura akanubaka uburyo bwo kurinda (umuyoboro, cloud, umwirondoro); ategura sisitemu zitekanye kuva mu itangiriro.", "**Security engineer / architect**: huunda na kujenga ulinzi (mtandao, cloud, utambulisho); husanifu mifumo salama tangu mwanzo."),
         ("**SOC analyst / incident responder**: watches alerts, investigates suspicious activity, contains and recovers from attacks (blue team).", "**Analyste SOC / répondant aux incidents** : surveille les alertes, enquête sur les activités suspectes, contient et rétablit après les attaques (blue team).", "**SOC analyst / incident responder**: akurikirana imenyesha, akora iperereza ku bikorwa bikekwa, agabanya akanagarura nyuma y'ibitero (blue team).", "**SOC analyst / incident responder**: hufuatilia tahadhari, huchunguza shughuli za kutiliwa shaka, huzuia na kurejesha baada ya mashambulizi (blue team)."),
         ("**Penetration tester / ethical hacker / red team**: with written permission, simulates attackers to find weaknesses before criminals do and reports how to fix them.", "**Testeur d'intrusion / hacker éthique / red team** : avec autorisation écrite, simule des attaquants pour trouver les faiblesses avant les criminels et indique comment corriger.", "**Penetration tester / ethical hacker / red team**: afite uruhushya rwanditse, yigana abagizi ba nabi kugira ngo abone intege nke mbere yabo agatanga inama zo gukosora.", "**Penetration tester / ethical hacker / red team**: kwa idhini ya maandishi, huiga washambuliaji kupata udhaifu kabla ya wahalifu na kueleza jinsi ya kurekebisha."),
         ("**Security analyst for governance, risk and compliance (GRC)**: policies, audits, risk registers, standards such as ISO 27001, privacy and legal obligations.", "**Analyste gouvernance, risques et conformité (GRC)** : politiques, audits, registres de risques, normes comme ISO 27001, vie privée et obligations légales.", "**GRC analyst (imiyoborere, ibyago, kubahiriza amategeko)**: amategeko y'imbere, audits, urutonde rw'ibyago, ibipimo nka ISO 27001, ibanga n'inshingano z'amategeko.", "**Mchambuzi wa GRC (usimamizi, hatari, kufuata sheria)**: sera, ukaguzi, rejista za hatari, viwango kama ISO 27001, faragha na wajibu wa kisheria."),
         ("**Digital forensics and malware analyst**: reconstructs what happened on a device, takes apart malware to learn how it works, supports investigations.", "**Analyste forensique et malwares** : reconstitue ce qui s'est passé sur un appareil, décortique les malwares pour comprendre leur fonctionnement, soutient les enquêtes.", "**Digital forensics na malware analyst**: asubiza ibyabaye ku gikoresho, asesengura malware kugira ngo amenye uko ikora, ashyigikira iperereza.", "**Mchunguzi wa kidijitali na mchambuzi wa malware**: hujenga upya kilichotokea kwenye kifaa, hutenganisha malware kuelewa inavyofanya kazi, husaidia uchunguzi."),
         ("**Application security (AppSec) / DevSecOps engineer**: reviews code, builds security into the pipeline, runs testing tools and trains developers.", "**Ingénieur sécurité applicative / DevSecOps** : relit le code, intègre la sécurité dans le pipeline, utilise des outils de test et forme les développeurs.", "**AppSec / DevSecOps engineer**: asuzuma code, ashyira umutekano mu mugongo w'iterambere, akoresha ibikoresho byo kugerageza kandi ahugura abategura porogaramu.", "**AppSec / DevSecOps engineer**: hukagua msimbo, huweka usalama kwenye bomba la uundaji, hutumia zana za majaribio na kuwafunza watengenezaji."),
         ("**CISO (Chief Information Security Officer)**: leads the security programme, budget and strategy and reports risk to leadership.", "**RSSI / CISO** : dirige le programme de sécurité, le budget et la stratégie, et rapporte les risques à la direction.", "**CISO (Chief Information Security Officer)**: ayobora gahunda y'umutekano, ingengo y'imari n'ingamba kandi agaragariza ubuyobozi ibyago.", "**CISO (Chief Information Security Officer)**: huongoza programu ya usalama, bajeti na mkakati na kuripoti hatari kwa uongozi."),
         ("**Skills to learn**: networking (TCP/IP, DNS, HTTP), Linux and Windows basics, scripting (Python, Bash), web basics, cryptography basics, then security tools and cloud. Also writing clearly and explaining risk to non-experts.", "**Compétences à acquérir** : réseaux (TCP/IP, DNS, HTTP), bases Linux et Windows, scripting (Python, Bash), bases du web, bases de cryptographie, puis outils de sécurité et cloud. Aussi : écrire clairement et expliquer le risque aux non-experts.", "**Ubumenyi bwo kwiga**: imiyoboro (TCP/IP, DNS, HTTP), ibanze bya Linux na Windows, scripting (Python, Bash), ibanze bya web, ibanze bya cryptography, hanyuma ibikoresho by'umutekano na cloud. Kandi no kwandika neza no gusobanurira abatari impuguke ibyago.", "**Ujuzi wa kujifunza**: mitandao (TCP/IP, DNS, HTTP), misingi ya Linux na Windows, scripting (Python, Bash), misingi ya wavuti, misingi ya kriptografia, kisha zana za usalama na cloud. Pia kuandika vizuri na kueleza hatari kwa wasio wataalamu."),
         ("**How to practise legally**: home labs, capture-the-flag (CTF) games, training platforms, bug-bounty programmes with clear rules. Never test systems you do not own or have written permission to test.", "**Pratiquer légalement** : labos à la maison, jeux CTF, plateformes de formation, programmes de bug bounty aux règles claires. Ne jamais tester des systèmes qui ne vous appartiennent pas sans autorisation écrite.", "**Uko witoza mu buryo bwemewe**: laboratwari yo mu rugo, imikino ya CTF, ahatangirwa amahugurwa, gahunda za bug bounty zifite amategeko asobanutse. Ntuzigere ugerageza sisitemu zitari izawe nta ruhushya rwanditse.", "**Jinsi ya kufanya mazoezi kisheria**: maabara ya nyumbani, michezo ya CTF, majukwaa ya mafunzo, programu za bug bounty zenye kanuni wazi. Kamwe usijaribu mifumo isiyo yako bila idhini ya maandishi."),
         ("**Certifications often asked for**: CompTIA Security+, CEH, CISSP (experienced), OSCP (hands-on testing), ISO 27001 Lead Implementer/Auditor, cloud-provider security certificates. Experience and a portfolio matter as much as certificates.", "**Certifications souvent demandées** : CompTIA Security+, CEH, CISSP (expérimentés), OSCP (tests pratiques), ISO 27001 Lead Implementer/Auditor, certifications de sécurité des fournisseurs cloud. L'expérience et un portfolio comptent autant.", "**Impamyabushobozi zisabwa kenshi**: CompTIA Security+, CEH, CISSP (abafite uburambe), OSCP (kugerageza mu bikorwa), ISO 27001 Lead Implementer/Auditor, iz'umutekano wa cloud. Uburambe n'ibyo wakoze bifite agaciro nk'impamyabushobozi.", "**Vyeti vinavyoombwa mara nyingi**: CompTIA Security+, CEH, CISSP (wenye uzoefu), OSCP (majaribio ya vitendo), ISO 27001 Lead Implementer/Auditor, vyeti vya usalama vya watoa cloud. Uzoefu na kazi ulizofanya ni muhimu kama vyeti.")],
        ("Security roles, skills and how to start", "Rôles, compétences et début de carrière en sécurité", "Inshingano, ubumenyi n'intangiriro mu mutekano", "Majukumu, ujuzi na kuanza katika usalama"),
        ["defense_overview", "hacker_types"]))
    return D
